<string_table>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_barrel_accuracy_name">
     <text>Barrel adjustment</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_barrel_accuracy_descr">
     <text>Reduces bullet dispersion, which improves accuracy.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_barrel_silencer_name">
     <text>Threaded barrel</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_barrel_silencer_descr">
     <text>Extended barrel, threaded for mounting a 9x19mm suppressor.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_barrel_bullet_speed_name">
     <text>Faster twist rate</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_barrel_bullet_speed_descr">
     <text>Barrel with a faster twist rate increases muzzle velocity.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_pokritie_name">
     <text>Protective coating</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_pokritie_descr">
