</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_zapiratel_name">
     <text>Improved locking mechanism</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_zapiratel_descr">
     <text>Improves obturation and muzzle velocity thanks to tighter lock-up.</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_shell_ejector_name">
