</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_kompensator_name">
     <text>Recoil reduction system</text>
</string>
<string id="gunsl_wpn_beretta_up_kompensator_descr">
     <text>Decreases felt recoil, making the shooting more comfortable.</text>
</string>
